# Deterministic catalogue name+description golden vectors.
# seed=0x0123456789ABCDEF instance="golden" count=5000 default template.
# CHANGING THIS FILE IS A BREAKING CHANGE: it pins ADR-004 generated
# names and descriptions and requires a scenario apiVersion bump (ADR-002).
# format: <kind> <index> <name> | <description>
tool 0 tool_00000 | generated instance reproducible primitive reproducible virtual primitive reproducible
tool 1 tool_00001 | overlay reproducible primitive primitive virtual generated catalog virtual
