tool 4999 tool_04999 | catalog catalog mock mock generated reproducible snapshot generated
prompt 0 prompt_00000 | reproducible catalog virtual catalog overlay catalog deterministic instance
prompt 1 prompt_00001 | reproducible deterministic deterministic deterministic snapshot virtual deterministic reproducible
prompt 2499 prompt_02499 | virtual primitive reproducible instance overlay deterministic primitive deterministic
prompt 4999 prompt_04999 | mock primitive generated generated virtual snapshot mock instance
